# Belt and braces.
#
# The Vercel project's Root Directory should be `web`. If it is ever misconfigured
# to the repo root, this file stops the Chrome extension source, the 60MB voice
# model and the internal planning docs from being served publicly — which is
# exactly what happened on the first deploy.
#
# Ignore everything, then re-include only the web app.
*
!web/
!web/**
